Output demo.mp4

Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1240
Set Height 900
Set Padding 26
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Set Shell "zsh"

Type "echo 'REDGREEN: a test only proves a fix when it fails without the fix'"
Enter
Sleep 1200ms
Type "REDGREEN_DEMO_SLOW=1 python3 demo.py"
Enter
Sleep 45s
